1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,580
It's crazy. I still can't believe she vanished.

2
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:12,480
And it was right at midnight. The instant the date changed, Yuzuru was erased.

3
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:16,800
We've got to figure out which of these 12 Natsumi is impersonating.

4
00:00:17,840 --> 00:00:23,160
Because it looks like if I don't, we run the risk of losing another person each night, one by one.

5
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:27,740
Yeah, that seems to be the case. The process of elimination will help.

6
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:31,060
Not much of a consolation when friends are vanishing, though.

7
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:38,100
I've got to find out who she is in a hurry. Not just for us, before Natsumi's sake too.

8
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:44,840
Well, in that case, isn't it about time for you to verify my identity? What if I'm her?

9
00:00:45,740 --> 00:00:50,840
No way. You're the real deal. At least that's what I'm hoping is the case with all my heart.

10
00:00:51,140 --> 00:00:55,920
What the hell does it matter what you want to believe? Your mission is to do what you can to verify it.

11
00:00:55,920 --> 00:01:00,660
You could grill me with questions or, I mean, to judge my reaction or whatever.

12
00:01:01,440 --> 00:01:05,080
You could, like, kiss me or something dumb like that.

13
00:01:05,820 --> 00:01:07,960
I see. Then.

14
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:11,320
Well. Oh, okay.

15
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:21,320
Big brother, what are you doing? Give me those. Come on, they're mine. Give them that. No, thanks.

16
00:01:21,320 --> 00:01:23,220
Oh, yeah. You're Coterie, all right.

17
00:01:23,560 --> 00:01:26,080
Natsumi couldn't play this side of you so perfectly.

18
00:01:26,640 --> 00:01:27,360
Isn't that right?

19
00:01:27,620 --> 00:01:28,500
Coterie.

20
00:01:29,460 --> 00:01:31,360
Oh, crap. I'm sorry.

21
00:01:31,940 --> 00:01:32,500
I'm afraid.

22
00:01:32,500 --> 00:01:38,860
I think we need to speed up the stating process.

23
00:01:39,720 --> 00:01:47,320
I agree. I know we've already scheduled a pretty packed day, but I don't care. Let's fit as many more in as we possibly can before tonight.

24
00:01:48,220 --> 00:01:50,140
I'll leave all the arrangements to you.

25
00:01:51,020 --> 00:01:56,940
Understood. I'll do the best I can. As for right now, you're due to meet Miku. Better hurry.

26
00:01:57,340 --> 00:01:58,480
I'm on it, thanks.

27
00:01:59,860 --> 00:02:05,060
Thanks for coming, Miku. But, hey, why did you want us to wear costumes? It's kind of weird.

28
00:02:05,500 --> 00:02:10,840
Oh, it's kind of an occupational hazard, I'm afraid. Being such a huge star means having to hide sometimes.

29
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:15,920
But I don't want you to worry. As you can see, we'll totally blend in if we cosplay here.

30
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:21,200
We're finally on a date by ourselves. I just didn't want anyone getting in the way of that.

31
00:02:21,880 --> 00:02:23,820
Huh. That actually makes sense.

32
00:02:24,300 --> 00:02:24,660
Whoa!

33
00:02:24,660 --> 00:02:24,940
Whoa!

34
00:02:24,940 --> 00:02:28,320
It's Kanon Tsukishima and Sieg from Valkyrie Misty!

35
00:02:28,480 --> 00:02:32,680
And you're in the rarely cosplay mask from Episode 6 when they saved Misty!

36
00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:34,280
Can we please take your picture?

37
00:02:34,640 --> 00:02:37,100
Wait, what? Oh, no. I don't think we had...

38
00:02:37,100 --> 00:02:38,620
Of course! We would be delighted!

39
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:44,740
Darling, your turn. Go on.

40
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:45,700
What? Me?

41
00:02:50,100 --> 00:02:53,720
There it is! The signature pose of our beloved Sieg!

42
00:02:53,720 --> 00:02:57,880
So, you gonna tell us why we're here or what?

43
00:02:58,220 --> 00:03:01,460
Because FYI, if you're making amends, this isn't enough.

44
00:03:01,460 --> 00:03:02,960
Oh, that's so lame, yo.

45
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:11,300
Oh, this has nothing to do with that day. Just thought we should hang. I mean, we're classmates, after all. I should know you better.

46
00:03:11,300 --> 00:03:19,040
So, what is it that's troubling you, Shido? Why is it you're suddenly interested in talking about the future?

47
00:03:19,040 --> 00:03:26,280
Uh, well, how do I put it? I guess I just feel like I need to start taking my life's path more seriously.

48
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:28,280
Oh, now I see.

49
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:33,020
In that case, do you remember the promise you made me?

50
00:03:33,240 --> 00:03:35,880
Because I haven't forgotten it, Shido.

51
00:03:38,780 --> 00:03:40,540
Hi-ya!

52
00:03:40,540 --> 00:03:44,040
No way!

53
00:03:44,040 --> 00:03:50,700
Ha-ha-ha! Did you see that? It was my signature move. You just witnessed the Dunkelhide win, Hosea.

54
00:03:50,700 --> 00:03:52,000
Uh-huh.

55
00:03:52,000 --> 00:04:02,380
Hmm. You'll never beat my crazy skills, Shido. Not now that I have this guy. With this legendary relic in my possession, you stand no chance of defeating me. So there!

56
00:04:02,380 --> 00:04:07,680
Wait, how is it legendary? I mean, didn't you just buy it from that lady?

57
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:16,380
Well, if I were you, I would try to focus on my game. Don't forget, we promised that the loser of this match would do whatever the winner wants.

58
00:04:16,380 --> 00:04:18,380
I'm well aware.

59
00:04:18,380 --> 00:04:20,380
Get ready for a comeback!

60
00:04:21,380 --> 00:04:24,380
And Shido's out, ladies and gents!

61
00:04:26,380 --> 00:04:27,380
Come sit by me.

62
00:04:27,380 --> 00:04:29,380
Yeah, okay.

63
00:04:32,380 --> 00:04:43,380
My first order is, for the next ten minutes, you won't act surprised or flustered, nor will you try to stop me, no matter what. And you'll promise me to never speak of it again.

64
00:04:47,380 --> 00:04:50,380
Right. Okay. I promise.

65
00:04:50,380 --> 00:04:51,380
Thank you.

66
00:04:53,380 --> 00:05:00,380
This is even more comfy than I thought it would be. Be good, and I'll turn you into my full-time pillow. How does that sound?

67
00:05:00,380 --> 00:05:02,380
You've gotta be kidding me.

68
00:05:02,380 --> 00:05:07,380
I'm sorry, are you complaining, my pet? Now then, I want you to rub my head very gently.

69
00:05:07,380 --> 00:05:09,380
As you wish, master.

70
00:05:13,380 --> 00:05:14,380
Hold on!

71
00:05:14,380 --> 00:05:21,380
What the? What's wrong?

72
00:05:25,380 --> 00:05:28,380
Yuzuru, I miss her.

73
00:05:28,380 --> 00:05:30,380
Oh, Kaguya. Of course.

74
00:05:30,380 --> 00:05:39,380
I know you said she was taking an exam, but really, you don't know where she is. I can tell. You think I'm stupid.

75
00:05:39,380 --> 00:05:41,380
I would never.

76
00:05:41,380 --> 00:05:45,380
But you thought it was better if I didn't know, right?

77
00:05:45,380 --> 00:05:54,380
So I'll trust you. Because that fateful day, the one who gave me and Yuzuru a third choice, that was you, Shido.

78
00:05:54,380 --> 00:05:55,380
Kaguya.

79
00:05:55,380 --> 00:06:01,380
So I'm begging you, please, save Yuzuru.

80
00:06:02,380 --> 00:06:15,380
Holy crap, you pathetic loser. Kidding. I meant the opposite of that. You beat the schedule and actually went on 11 different dates in two days. I'm exhausted thinking about it.

81
00:06:15,380 --> 00:06:18,380
Well, can't complain. I'm the one who asked for it.

82
00:06:18,380 --> 00:06:22,380
So? Did you sense anything wrong when you were talking to anyone?

83
00:06:23,380 --> 00:06:31,380
No, nothing in particular. There's no doubt in my mind that Miku and Kaguya are real, and neither my teacher nor the girls seemed off to me.

84
00:06:32,380 --> 00:06:39,380
This is hard. I know we need to figure it all out, but I dread knowing who Natsumi is.

85
00:06:39,380 --> 00:06:45,380
Yeah. Sorry, bro. Unfortunately, I think it's time for you to give her an answer.

86
00:06:46,380 --> 00:06:51,380
I know. Except, even if I wanted to make some kind of guess, how am I supposed to do that?

87
00:06:52,380 --> 00:06:58,380
Hmm. We don't really know that either. This game seems guided by nothing but Natsumi's wins. She's holding all the cards.

88
00:06:59,380 --> 00:07:02,380
I imagine even right now she's observing us from somewhere close by.

89
00:07:03,380 --> 00:07:04,380
Right on the money!

90
00:07:06,380 --> 00:07:07,380
You stay back!

91
00:07:09,380 --> 00:07:11,380
Natsumi!

92
00:07:12,380 --> 00:07:18,380
Ah! Good evening, Shido. Day two of the game is now at an end. Tell me something, are you having fun yet?

93
00:07:19,380 --> 00:07:26,380
What is this even about, Natsumi? I never asked to play this game! Just bring Yuzuru back now and we can talk about anything you want!

94
00:07:26,380 --> 00:07:39,380
Sorry, no chance. It's a bummer if you're not feeling up to the task, but the cork's kinda already out of the bottle, if you know what I mean. So, no time like the present, right? Why don't you give me your guess for today? Who am I impersonating?

95
00:07:39,380 --> 00:07:40,380
I-I don't-

96
00:07:40,380 --> 00:07:41,380
I-I don't-

97
00:07:42,380 --> 00:07:47,380
Shido, some won't be erased if you don't answer her. Even a wild guess'll do.

98
00:07:47,380 --> 00:08:00,380
I think the one you're impersonating is Yoshino. I'm not confident in that, but she did seem unusually bold.

99
00:08:00,380 --> 00:08:04,380
I see. Well...

100
00:08:04,380 --> 00:08:06,380
Natsumi, wait!

101
00:08:06,380 --> 00:08:07,380
Natsumi, wait!

102
00:08:07,380 --> 00:08:10,380
She's gone! Do you think you were right?

103
00:08:10,380 --> 00:08:13,380
Shin, Coterie, do you copy?

104
00:08:13,380 --> 00:08:15,380
Reina? We're here. What's up?

105
00:08:15,380 --> 00:08:25,380
Just now, Natsumi's angel showed up again. Two more people have disappeared. Both Aiyama Buki and Yoshino.

106
00:08:25,380 --> 00:08:40,380
Two more days have passed, and I still haven't guessed correctly. Ms. Okamine, Mai Hazakura, me, Fujibakama, and Tonomachi have all been erased.

107
00:08:40,380 --> 00:08:43,380
Shin, you're almost to the spot.

108
00:08:43,380 --> 00:08:45,380
Sorry, did you wait long?

109
00:08:45,380 --> 00:08:47,380
I just got here.

110
00:08:47,380 --> 00:08:52,380
For the record, I've been observing her. She's been waiting there for over an hour.

111
00:08:52,380 --> 00:08:55,380
Well, what are we seeing?

112
00:08:55,380 --> 00:08:58,380
I don't know. I hadn't really decided.

113
00:08:58,380 --> 00:09:06,380
So, in other words, you invited me not because you wanted to see a specific film, but instead because you wanted to spend some time with me.

114
00:09:06,380 --> 00:09:11,380
Um, yeah. I mean, I guess. Sure.

115
00:09:15,380 --> 00:09:17,380
How far are we going?

116
00:09:17,380 --> 00:09:19,380
As far as you want.

117
00:09:19,380 --> 00:09:21,380
Morikami?

118
00:09:32,380 --> 00:09:34,380
Shido, I want you to touch me.

119
00:09:34,380 --> 00:09:36,380
No brawl for easy access.

120
00:09:36,380 --> 00:09:39,380
What? Here? You don't mean that.

121
00:09:39,380 --> 00:09:52,380
That wore me out. Mind, body, and soul.

122
00:09:52,380 --> 00:09:53,380
Shido!

123
00:09:53,380 --> 00:09:56,380
Tolka! What are you doing out this late?

124
00:09:56,380 --> 00:10:03,380
I wanted to check on you. These past few days, you've just seemed so preoccupied. I've been a little worried about you.

125
00:10:05,380 --> 00:10:06,380
Sorry.

126
00:10:06,380 --> 00:10:12,380
Oh no, you don't have to apologize. You're doing something important that you have to do. Isn't that right?

127
00:10:12,380 --> 00:10:19,380
It's just, it's sad not being able to see you, that's all. If there's anything I can do to help, just say the word, okay?

128
00:10:19,380 --> 00:10:23,380
Thank you. You're so sweet. I already feel like a whole new man.

129
00:10:23,380 --> 00:10:25,380
Yay! That makes me happy.

130
00:10:25,380 --> 00:10:26,380
Me too.

131
00:10:30,380 --> 00:10:35,380
I'm so sorry to bother you. If I wanted to get to Tengu Street, would this be the right direction?

132
00:10:35,380 --> 00:10:39,380
Yeah, that's right. Turn left at the second light and you'll run directly into it.

133
00:10:40,380 --> 00:10:46,380
Thanks a lot. Broken GPS. I appreciate that you young lovers were willing to help me out.

134
00:10:50,380 --> 00:10:52,380
What do you think? Did I sound awkward back there?

135
00:10:52,380 --> 00:10:55,380
No, I highly doubt they suspect anything.

136
00:10:56,380 --> 00:11:04,380
So that's Shido Itsuka, as well as the famous princess. They certainly don't seem any worse for wear.

137
00:11:04,380 --> 00:11:07,380
Well then, good night Shido. Natsumi!

138
00:11:08,380 --> 00:11:10,380
Yeah, good night Toka. Natsumi!

139
00:11:13,380 --> 00:11:16,380
Natsumi. Or in other words, I love you.

140
00:11:20,380 --> 00:11:21,380
Hey Coterie, I'm home.

141
00:11:22,380 --> 00:11:25,380
Shido! There you are! Where the hell have you been?

142
00:11:25,380 --> 00:11:27,380
I just heard from Reina a second ago.

143
00:11:28,380 --> 00:11:31,380
She said it's Toka. Toka has vanished!

144
00:11:34,380 --> 00:11:40,380
Please no, Toka! Toka! Toka!

145
00:11:45,380 --> 00:11:48,380
Oh? Is it panic I hear in your sweet little voice?

146
00:11:49,380 --> 00:11:50,380
Shido.

147
00:11:51,380 --> 00:11:52,380
Natsumi!

148
00:11:52,380 --> 00:11:57,380
Hey now, this isn't my fault. You're the one who didn't come home when you were supposed to.

149
00:11:58,380 --> 00:12:03,380
I assumed you were forfeiting your guess tonight, so I did the thing and erase another person. You know how it goes.

150
00:12:03,380 --> 00:12:04,380
You are the worst.

151
00:12:05,380 --> 00:12:08,380
Still though, I'm kinda thinking I wanna end this pretty soon.

152
00:12:09,380 --> 00:12:10,380
Wanna end what? What does that mean?

153
00:12:11,380 --> 00:12:24,380
What it means is, if you guess correctly, I'll return all the people who have disappeared. Just know. If you don't guess right, then it's officially my win. And I'll take the place of every one of your missing friends from now on.

154
00:12:24,380 --> 00:12:35,380
Those twelve precious friends of yours will unfortunately never be returning to this world ever again. Since this time is kinda special, I'll be back at 11.30 tonight.

155
00:12:36,380 --> 00:12:40,380
Natsumi, wait! Natsumi!

156
00:12:45,380 --> 00:12:51,380
I'll get it right. I'll save them. I will. All of them.

157
00:12:51,380 --> 00:13:04,380
That's Shido. He makes the most adorable face whenever someone disappears. But that's not nearly enough for me. I want you to show me what true despair is!

158
00:13:05,380 --> 00:13:18,380
That's the unlucky fate of those who see my dark secret. I'll watch you drown in your sorrow. And then nobody will be able to find me. Not that anybody looks for me anyway.

159
00:13:18,380 --> 00:13:19,380
I want you to show me.

160
00:13:26,380 --> 00:13:29,380
Yo! It's been quite a while. How long, Elliot?

161
00:13:30,380 --> 00:13:34,380
Thirty years, give or take. You seem well, I. Good for you.

162
00:13:41,380 --> 00:13:42,380
Okay, that's everyone, then.

163
00:13:43,380 --> 00:13:44,380
Shido.

164
00:13:44,380 --> 00:13:53,380
I know it's a lot, but at least now you understand what we're facing. I got you all involved in this. And I'm so sorry.

165
00:13:54,380 --> 00:14:00,380
Look, don't worry about that. I just wish you'd told the truth. It really would have helped when Yuzuru disappeared.

166
00:14:00,380 --> 00:14:05,380
This is embarrassing, but I think I'm the most sad to hear that our date was just a part of a research operation.

167
00:14:06,380 --> 00:14:10,380
I have a long list of questions about this. But for now, I'll let it go and cooperate.

168
00:14:10,380 --> 00:14:11,380
Thank you all. I mean it.

169
00:14:11,380 --> 00:14:20,380
Okay, let's go through it all again. Natsumi is impersonating one of these twelve, and it could be anyone. These have been Shido's guesses so far.

170
00:14:20,380 --> 00:14:35,380
Yoshino, Misokamine, and Maihazakura. I think we can exclude these three. In turn, Natsumi has erased. Yuzuru, Aiyama Buki, Hiroto Tonomachi, Miifuji Bakama, and Toka.

171
00:14:35,380 --> 00:14:47,380
It's possible that she was actually one of those five. And then there are the five of us, of course. That makes us strong suspects. Although, to impersonate one of us might pose a little more of a challenge for her.

172
00:14:47,380 --> 00:14:54,380
Huh? Wait, what do you mean by that? I get it. Our traits are too unique and complex, and that makes us hard to imitate, right?

173
00:14:54,380 --> 00:14:57,380
Sure, yeah. Let's go with that.

174
00:14:57,380 --> 00:15:10,380
This witch. The spirit you're calling Natsumi. Why would she take such a huge risk? The way she's handled it so far, every time a person disappears, it just increases our chances of guessing right.

175
00:15:10,380 --> 00:15:21,380
So by the end, it'll be hard for us to lose. Which means the witch is confident we won't choose her. She knows that no matter what we might come at her with, it will never be the correct answer.

176
00:15:21,380 --> 00:15:30,380
For example, she concealed herself inside a photo or something.

177
00:15:30,380 --> 00:15:35,380
A good point. That is exactly the sort of creative thinking we need right now.

178
00:15:35,380 --> 00:15:42,380
Don't you think maybe it's possible she isn't impersonating anybody at all? I really can't imagine that's the case.

179
00:15:42,380 --> 00:15:52,380
Horikami is right. Why am I trusting Natsumi to play by the rules? She'd do anything to win. Which means she could even be one of these five.

180
00:15:53,380 --> 00:15:55,380
What a party!

181
00:16:01,380 --> 00:16:02,380
Natsumi!

182
00:16:02,380 --> 00:16:04,380
She's the one!

183
00:16:04,380 --> 00:16:07,380
Aw, she's so gorgeous, it's not fair!

184
00:16:07,380 --> 00:16:16,380
Thanks for that. Now then, it's the night we've all been waiting for. What do you say? Do you think you can finally guess who I'm impersonating tonight, Cheeto?

185
00:16:16,380 --> 00:16:20,380
Yeah, I'll get it all right. And you know what? It's for your sake too!

186
00:16:20,380 --> 00:16:32,380
Eh, sure, give it your best shot. Now tonight is special because I'm gonna give you three guesses. You'll know right away if you're wrong, cause one of your friends here will disappear right before your eyes.

187
00:16:32,380 --> 00:16:37,380
Isn't it exciting? Come on, Cheeto, give me the first name. Don't be Sean.

188
00:16:37,380 --> 00:16:48,380
Okay. Well then for starters, I know you can't be one of the four people standing in this room. I can't imagine you'd bet everything on a game you had a 75% chance of losing.

189
00:16:48,380 --> 00:17:03,380
So in other words, you're somewhere among the five people that you've erased. You made yourself safe as quickly as possible, as someone we'd least expect. And that is...

190
00:17:03,380 --> 00:17:05,380
Yuzuru, the one who went first.

191
00:17:05,380 --> 00:17:12,380
Shida, what are you saying? Yuzuru was the real deal. I am positive that she was my sister.

192
00:17:12,380 --> 00:17:23,380
The thing is, I'm not certain about this either. At least, if Natsumi actually was Yuzuru, everything would make sense.

193
00:17:23,380 --> 00:17:26,380
Oh, what a shame. You're so wrong.

194
00:17:26,380 --> 00:17:37,380
You guys, she literally disappeared. You're kidding. It really wasn't Yuzuru? I've been saying that the whole time.

195
00:17:37,380 --> 00:17:47,380
What's next, my darling little detectives? Who are you gonna name now? Don't take too much time, or I'll just have to suck someone else up.

196
00:17:47,380 --> 00:17:54,380
Elliot is on the move, too. It's time to fill the vacancy in your support personnel.

197
00:17:54,380 --> 00:17:59,380
The trick is, finding someone who's worthy of an adeptus number. Easier said than done.

198
00:17:59,380 --> 00:18:06,380
Is it really, though? What about the one who gave you that scar? Now there's an outstanding wizard.

199
00:18:06,380 --> 00:18:08,380
Damn it!

200
00:18:08,380 --> 00:18:11,380
Keep it together, Shida. I think you're on the right track here.

201
00:18:11,380 --> 00:18:14,380
Which one is Natsumi? Who is she?

202
00:18:14,380 --> 00:18:17,380
I can't cope! I have no clue how it is!

203
00:18:17,380 --> 00:18:19,380
We don't know enough to make a guess yet!

204
00:18:19,380 --> 00:18:25,380
Sorry, gang, but time's almost up. I may just go ahead and vanish someone if I get tired of waiting.

205
00:18:25,380 --> 00:18:28,380
Hold on! I think it's him!

206
00:18:28,380 --> 00:18:31,380
Oh, too bad. Better luck next time!

207
00:18:31,380 --> 00:18:33,380
Ah!

208
00:18:33,380 --> 00:18:35,380
Kaguya!

209
00:18:35,380 --> 00:18:41,380
Time for the grand finale, so this is your last chance. Who will you choose to be your final guess?

210
00:18:41,380 --> 00:18:44,380
I can't take this, my darling! I can't!

211
00:18:44,380 --> 00:18:49,380
To think I was lucky enough to finally meet Shida, and now I have to turn around and disappear!

212
00:18:49,380 --> 00:18:51,380
Keep it together, Miku! You have to stay calm!

213
00:18:51,380 --> 00:18:54,380
FYI, just 30 seconds left.

214
00:18:55,380 --> 00:19:02,380
Darling, look at me. This is for you. I just can't bear to disappear without leaving a piece of me with you.

215
00:19:02,380 --> 00:19:03,380
Miku!

216
00:19:03,380 --> 00:19:07,380
Because if I wear this, then it'll only end up vanishing together with me!

217
