220
00:19:21,380 --> 00:19:30,380
I've got it, Natsumi. I mean, I know the reason you're so confident.

221
00:19:31,380 --> 00:19:37,380
While it's true that you're impersonating someone in one of the 12 pictures, it is not one of the people.

222
00:19:39,380 --> 00:19:42,380
