235
00:20:38,380 --> 00:20:41,380
So weird! I feel like I've been taking the longest nap ever!

236
00:20:42,380 --> 00:20:44,380
Doubt. Why exactly am I here?

237
00:20:45,380 --> 00:20:46,380
You're back! Yuzuru!

238
00:20:47,380 --> 00:20:48,380
Oh, thank goodness. You all look okay.

239
00:20:53,380 --> 00:20:54,380
Hey, Natsumi.

240
00:20:55,380 --> 00:20:58,380
Care to explain why you did this? Because we're all listening.

241
00:21:03,380 --> 00:21:05,380
Holy crap. Are you Natsumi?

242
00:21:06,380 --> 00:21:07,380
Huh?

243
00:21:08,380 --> 00:21:09,380
Ah?

244
00:21:09,380 --> 00:21:10,380
Ah!

245
00:21:10,380 --> 00:21:11,380
