253
00:21:39,380 --> 00:21:42,380
We'll meet again. Rest assured, I'll have my revenge!

254
00:21:43,380 --> 00:21:44,380
Wait! Don't go! We can talk!

255
00:21:44,380 --> 00:21:45,380
